<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Silicon Graphics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Silicon Graphics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst Laura Conigliaro upgraded Silicon Graphics Inc to the brokerage's U.S. recommended list from market performer previously, her office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was travelling and not immediately avaialble to comment.</p>
<p>-- The office declined to comment on Conigliaro's new target price for the stock.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736  </p>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs later officiallly confirmed the change.</p>
</text>
